## **STEP 5: Deploy to Vercel (2 minutes)**

Go to **vercel.com**

Click **"Sign Up"** (you can use your GitHub account)

Click **"Continue with GitHub"**

Authorize Vercel to access GitHub

Once logged in, click **"New Project"**

Click **"Import Git Repository"**

You should see your `car-scanner-dashboard` repo listed

Click on it

Click **"Deploy"**

Wait 2-3 minutes... You'll see it building.

When it's done, you'll get a URL like:
```
https://car-scanner-dashboard-xyz.vercel.app
